age\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20071224094745&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Atlas_571fc2.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an atlas.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 13.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It is filled with detailed maps of Tibia.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Can be purchased by every member of <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibian%20Explorer%20Society\">Tibian Explorer Society</a> with rank of Relic Hunter or higher. They are commonly used for decorative purposes. People who've completed the Explorer Society Quest can sell them for a higher price to other players.<br/>Looks the same as a Book (Atlas), a <a href=\"#/wiki/Book%20%28CGB%29\">Book (CGB)</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Strange%20Good%20Night%20Songs\">Strange Good Night Songs</a>.\n</p>\n<p>Used in part of the <a href=\"#/quest/the-shattered-isles-quest\">Meriana Quest</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Angus\">Angus</a>